(628, 203, 'weekly_summary', 'Your Weekly Health Summary', 'During the past week, you have faced several challenges in tracking your health goals. Out of the seven days, there were many missed goals, with only one day showing partial achievement in weight and hydration. Unfortunately, most of the health metrics like steps, sleep, and nutrition were not logged, which hindered your overall progress.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To improve your health tracking, consider setting reminders to log your daily activities and goals. Start small by focusing on one or two areas, such as hydration and steps, and gradually incorporate more metrics, like nutrition and sleep. Every little step counts; keep pushing forward!\"}', '2026-03-15 03:00:16', 'sent', '2026-03-15 03:00:16', '2026-03-15 03:00:16'),
(629, 230, 'weekly_summary', 'Your Weekly Health Summary', 'During this tracking period, there were very few health goals achieved. Out of seven days, only one day had partial tracking with some logged values for weight, steps, and hydration, while all other days resulted in missed goals. Notably, sleep and nutrition goals were entirely untracked throughout the week.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To improve your health tracking, consider logging your data daily. Start with one aspect, such as steps or hydration, to build consistency. Small, achievable goals can set the foundation for better tracking and progress!\"}', '2026-03-15 03:00:21', 'sent', '2026-03-15 03:00:21', '2026-03-15 03:00:21'),
(630, 233, 'weekly_summary', 'Your Weekly Health Summary', 'During the period from March 9 to March 15, 2026, no health tracking data was logged. All goals related to weight, steps, sleep, hydration, nutrition, and fasting were missed, indicating a lack of recorded activity.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"It\'s important to start tracking your daily health habits to gain insights into your progress. Consider setting reminders or using a health app to log your data regularly. Small steps towards your goals can lead to significant improvements over time!\"}', '2026-03-15 03:00:24', 'sent', '2026-03-15 03:00:24', '2026-03-15 03:00:24'),
(631, 237, 'weekly_summary', 'Your Weekly Health Summary', 'During the past week, none of your health goals for weight, steps, sleep, hydration, nutrition, or fasting were logged. All health metrics indicated missed goals, suggesting that tracking your daily activities was not done at all.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To improve your health tracking, consider setting reminders to log your daily activities. Start small by focusing on one area, like hydration or steps. Progress will come with consistency, and remember that every small effort counts toward your overall wellness!\"}', '2026-03-15 03:00:29', 'sent', '2026-03-15 03:00:29', '2026-03-15 03:00:29'),
(632, 239, 'weekly_summary', 'Your Weekly Health Summary', 'During the past week, all health goals were missed due to a lack of logged data. Daily targets for weight, steps, sleep, hydration, nutrition, and fasting were all untracked, indicating no health activity recording. This absence of data suggests that the user did not engage in monitoring their health during this time.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"It\\u2019s important to start tracking your daily health activities to gain insights and improve your well-being. Consider setting reminders or using a health app to log your meals, steps, and hydration. Small, consistent efforts can lead to significant improvements over time. Remember, every step counts!\"}', '2026-03-15 03:00:33', 'sent', '2026-03-15 03:00:33', '2026-03-15 03:00:33'),
(633, 241, 'weekly_summary', 'Your Weekly Health Summary', 'Unfortunately, there are no logged health activities over the past week. All goals for weight, steps, sleep, hydration, nutrition, and fasting were missed without any recorded data.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"Consider setting reminders to track your health goals daily. Start with small, achievable targets like logging your water intake or daily steps, and gradually increase as you build consistency. Remember, every little effort counts towards your overall wellbeing!\"}', '2026-03-15 03:00:38', 'sent', '2026-03-15 03:00:38', '2026-03-15 03:00:38'),
(634, 242, 'weekly_summary', 'Your Weekly Health Summary', 'Your health data tracking for the past week shows that all goals—including weight, steps, sleep, hydration, nutrition, and fasting—were missed or unlogged. Unfortunately, it seems that there has been no recorded activity, suggesting a lack of tracking during this period.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To improve your health tracking, consider setting reminders to log daily activities. Starting small, like tracking just one goal (e.g., steps), can help build consistency. Remember, every step counts, and it\'s never too late to begin again!\"}', '2026-03-15 03:00:41', 'sent', '2026-03-15 03:00:41', '2026-03-15 03:00:41'),
(635, 243, 'weekly_summary', 'Your Weekly Health Summary', 'During the past week, all health goals regarding weight, steps, sleep, hydration, nutrition, and fasting were not tracked, resulting in missed opportunities for improvement. There is a complete lack of data on your activities.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To enhance your health journey, consider establishing a daily tracking routine to log your activities and goals. Start with small steps, like setting reminders to track your hydration or steps, and gradually build up your consistency. Remember, every small effort counts!\"}', '2026-03-15 03:00:46', 'sent', '2026-03-15 03:00:46', '2026-03-15 03:00:46'),
(636, 246, 'weekly_summary', 'Your Weekly Health Summary', 'Over the past week, health tracking has not been consistently logged, with most goals not met. Only hydration was successfully achieved on one day, indicating a partial commitment to water intake. Weight and sleep goals were only partially met once, but steps, nutrition, and fasting were completely unlogged for the week.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To improve your health tracking, try setting reminders for daily logging to stay accountable. Start with small, achievable goals like tracking hydration or steps, and gradually build from there. Every little step counts towards your overall wellness journey!\"}', '2026-03-15 03:00:50', 'sent', '2026-03-15 03:00:50', '2026-03-15 03:00:50'),
(637, 248, 'weekly_summary', 'Your Weekly Health Summary', 'During the last week, no health goals were tracked, leading to missed targets for weight, steps, sleep, hydration, nutrition, and fasting. Overall, there is insufficient data to assess progress or achievements.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To enhance your health tracking, consider setting a daily reminder to log your activities and focus on one goal at a time. Small, consistent actions can lead to significant improvements in your overall health.\"}', '2026-03-15 03:00:53', 'sent', '2026-03-15 03:00:53', '2026-03-15 03:00:53'),
(638, 250, 'weekly_summary', 'Your Weekly Health Summary', 'During the tracking period, you\'ve shown some dedication to your health goals, successfully completing your step goal on two days and partially achieving your weight goal on multiple days. However, there were consistent misses in hydration, sleep, nutrition, and fasting logging, indicating room for improvement. Most of the days were either missed or had unlogged data, making it challenging to get a complete picture of your health during this time.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To enhance your health tracking, consider setting reminders for logging your data daily. Focus on hydrating more thoroughly, maintaining a consistent sleep schedule, and incorporating balanced meals into your nutrition plan. Small, consistent changes can lead to significant improvements over time. You\'ve got this!\"}', '2026-03-15 03:00:57', 'sent', '2026-03-15 03:00:57', '2026-03-15 03:00:57'),
(639, 252, 'weekly_summary', 'Your Weekly Health Summary', 'During this week, you managed to partially achieve your weight goal on two days, with one day recording a successful step count of over 12,000 steps. However, many of your goals for hydration, sleep, nutrition, and fasting were not logged, indicating a significant amount of missing data.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To improve your health tracking, consider setting reminders to log your daily activities. Aim to log at least your hydration and sleep every day. Small changes can lead to big results. Keep it up!\"}', '2026-03-15 03:01:04', 'sent', '2026-03-15 03:01:04', '2026-03-15 03:01:04'),
