(682, 203, 'daily_summary', 'Your Daily Health Summary', 'It appears that you did not track your health data on March 15, 2026. All the goals for weight, steps, sleep, hydration, nutrition, and fasting were missed due to no entries. Consistent logging is essential for understanding your health patterns and progress.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"Consider setting reminders to log your health data daily. Start small with one or two categories to track, like hydration and steps, to make it manageable. Your health journey is unique, and every small step counts!\"}', '2026-03-15 14:00:13', 'sent', '2026-03-15 14:00:13', '2026-03-15 14:00:13'),
(683, 230, 'daily_summary', 'Your Daily Health Summary', 'It appears that no health data was tracked for this date. All goals related to weight, steps, sleep, hydration, nutrition, and fasting were missed, indicating a lack of submissions or engagement with your health tracking.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To improve your health, consider setting a routine for daily tracking. Use reminders to log your data and gradually introduce small changes to meet your goals. Remember, every step counts towards a healthier you!\"}', '2026-03-15 14:00:17', 'sent', '2026-03-15 14:00:17', '2026-03-15 14:00:17'),
(684, 233, 'daily_summary', 'Your Daily Health Summary', 'During the tracking period, no health goals were met, and all data points were either missing or unlogged. It\'s important to prioritize health tracking to gain insights and monitor your progress effectively.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"Start by logging your daily efforts, even small achievements. Consider setting reminders to track your weight, steps, sleep, hydration, nutrition, and fasting. Remember, every step counts towards a healthier lifestyle!\"}', '2026-03-15 14:00:22', 'sent', '2026-03-15 14:00:22', '2026-03-15 14:00:22'),
(685, 237, 'daily_summary', 'Your Daily Health Summary', 'It appears that on March 15, 2026, all health goals were missed, and there was a complete lack of tracking for weight, steps, sleep, hydration, and nutrition. This suggests that health data was not logged for this day.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To improve your health tracking, consider setting reminders to log your daily activities. Small consistent efforts can lead to positive results over time!\"}', '2026-03-15 14:00:27', 'sent', '2026-03-15 14:00:27', '2026-03-15 14:00:27'),
(686, 239, 'daily_summary', 'Your Daily Health Summary', 'During the tracked day, all health goals related to weight, steps, sleep, hydration, nutrition, and fasting were missed or not logged. There is no data available to assess your overall health activity for this period.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"Consider setting a reminder or tracking your goals regularly to stay on top of your health. Even small steps toward logging your activities can contribute significantly to your well-being. You can start by aiming for consistent tracking this week!\"}', '2026-03-15 14:00:30', 'sent', '2026-03-15 14:00:30', '2026-03-15 14:00:30'),
