(688, 242, 'daily_summary', 'Your Daily Health Summary', 'During the tracking period, all health goals related to weight, steps, sleep, hydration, and nutrition were missed with no actual data logged. This indicates a significant lack of tracked health activity.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"Consider setting reminders to log your daily activities and health metrics. Start small and aim for consistent tracking to better understand your health habits. Taking just a few steps each day can lead to significant improvements over time!\"}', '2026-03-15 14:00:37', 'sent', '2026-03-15 14:00:37', '2026-03-15 14:00:37'),
(689, 243, 'daily_summary', 'Your Daily Health Summary', 'During the tracked day, no health goals were achieved as all metrics, including weight, steps, sleep, hydration, nutrition, and fasting, were unlogged or missed. There is no recorded data for actual achievements.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"It\'s important to start tracking your health data consistently. Try setting reminders for weighing yourself, logging your daily steps, and noting your sleep hours. Consider keeping a journal or using an app to help maintain your goals and stay motivated!\"}', '2026-03-15 14:00:40', 'sent', '2026-03-15 14:00:40', '2026-03-15 14:00:40'),
(690, 246, 'daily_summary', 'Your Daily Health Summary', 'On March 15, 2026, you made notable strides in your health goals. You successfully completed your hydration and nutrition goals, reflecting your commitment to staying nourished and hydrated. However, you only partially met your weight, steps, and sleep goals, indicating areas for potential improvement.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"Consider setting a more attainable daily step goal to gradually increase your activity level. Focus on improving your sleep hours by establishing a calming nighttime routine. Keep up the great work on hydration and nutrition, and aim for consistency in all areas!\"}', '2026-03-15 14:00:44', 'sent', '2026-03-15 14:00:44', '2026-03-15 14:00:44'),
(691, 248, 'daily_summary', 'Your Daily Health Summary', 'During the tracking period, all health goals related to weight, steps, sleep, hydration, nutrition, and fasting were missed due to unlogged data. Unfortunately, it appears that health activities were not recorded on this date.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To enhance your health tracking, consider setting reminders to log your daily activities. Prioritizing small, manageable goals each day can help you stay motivated and make progress. Remember, every small step counts toward your overall well-being!\"}', '2026-03-15 14:00:49', 'sent', '2026-03-15 14:00:49', '2026-03-15 14:00:49'),
(692, 250, 'daily_summary', 'Your Daily Health Summary', 'On March 15, 2026, you made significant progress towards your weight goal, achieving a weight of 72.2 kg against a goal of 75 kg. However, you fell short in the areas of steps, sleep, and hydration, with key data missing for your nutrition and fasting. While you are on track with your weight, it\'s important to focus on logging all health metrics for a clearer picture of your overall well-being.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To enhance your health tracking, consider setting reminders for daily entries, especially for sleep, hydration, and nutrition. Aim to reach your step goal by gradually increasing your daily activity. Consistent tracking will help you identify trends and stay motivated towards all your health goals!\"}', '2026-03-15 14:00:53', 'sent', '2026-03-15 14:00:53', '2026-03-15 14:00:53'),
(693, 252, 'daily_summary', 'Your Daily Health Summary', 'On March 15, 2026, you achieved your hydration goal by drinking 3 liters of water. However, you fell short in other areas: your weight was below your goal, but only partially met the steps and sleep targets. Nutrition was unlogged, and fasting details were missing.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To improve your tracking, aim for consistent logging, especially for nutrition and fasting. Setting smaller, achievable daily goals can help you gradually meet your health targets. Keep up the momentum with hydration!\"}', '2026-03-15 14:00:59', 'sent', '2026-03-15 14:00:59', '2026-03-15 14:00:59'),
(694, 255, 'daily_summary', 'Your Daily Health Summary', 'It appears that on March 15, 2026, you did not track your weight, steps, sleep, and hydration goals, all of which were missed. However, you successfully logged your nutrition intake, meeting the target of 550 calories. Sadly, fasting data is missing as well, indicating more thorough tracking is needed to get a clearer picture of your health habits.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To improve your health tracking, consider logging all goals daily, focusing on areas you missed. Establish a routine for logging your steps, sleep, and hydration to help boost your overall health engagement.\"}', '2026-03-15 14:01:05', 'sent', '2026-03-15 14:01:05', '2026-03-15 14:01:05'),
