(799, 250, 'daily_summary', 'Your Daily Health Summary', 'On March 16, 2026, you made partial progress towards your weight and steps goals, successfully managing to achieve your weight target of 72.2 kg against a goal of 75 kg. However, sleep, hydration, and nutrition goals were missed with no data logged. The fasting information appears to be untracked as well.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To enhance your health journey, try to log your daily goals consistently, especially focusing on sleep and hydration, which are crucial for overall well-being. Small adjustments like setting reminders for hydration and maintaining a sleep schedule can lead to remarkable improvements. Keep up the great work on weight management and steps!\"}', '2026-03-16 14:01:00', 'sent', '2026-03-16 14:01:00', '2026-03-16 14:01:00'),
