(801, 255, 'daily_summary', 'Your Daily Health Summary', 'On March 16, 2026, you successfully maintained a weight of 72.2 kg, which is commendable and shows that you are close to your goal weight of 78 kg. However, you fell short on your activity levels with only 3,335 steps out of the target of 12,000. Additionally, your sleep, hydration, nutrition, and fasting data were not logged, indicating missed opportunities for holistic health tracking.', 'normal', 'open_summary', '{\"recommendations\":\"To enhance your health journey, try to log your sleep and hydration consistently. Aim to gradually increase your daily step count, and consider establishing a regular eating schedule to support better nutrition and fasting practices. Keep up the great work with your weight management!\"}', '2026-03-16 14:01:15', 'sent', '2026-03-16 14:01:15', '2026-03-16 14:01:15'),
