(212, 'https://gravity.attoexasolutions.com/post_images/1770733594_698b401a4103a.jpeg', '🍽 Food Analysis Result\n\nCalories: 320 kcal\nProtein: 35 g\nCarbs: 4 g\nFat: 18 g\nFiber: 0 g\nHealth Score: 75/100\n\n💬 This pepper soup with beef provides a strong source of protein and is rich in flavor from spices and broth. While it is low in fiber and modest in carbohydrates, it can be a nourishing meal when balanced with fiber-rich vegetables or whole grains alongside. What part of this meal felt most intentional for you?', 'pepper soup with beef', 'published', 0, 0, 1, 0, 101, 2, '2026-02-10 08:26:41', '2026-03-03 14:42:50'),
