(248, 'https://gravity.attoexasolutions.com/post_images/1773343009_69b3112120349.jpeg', '🍽 Food Analysis Result\n\nCalories: 350 kcal\nProtein: 30 g\nCarbs: 25 g\nFat: 15 g\nFiber: 8 g\nSodium: 450 mg\nHealth Score: 80/100\n\n💬 This meal shows strong inclusion of vegetables and a good protein source, which are key to balanced nutrition. The variety of colorful veggies adds valuable fiber and micronutrients, supporting overall health. How did this combination fit into your day and how did it nourish you?', 'carrot and vegetables', 'published', 0, 0, 0, 0, 230, 2, '2026-03-12 13:17:09', '2026-03-12 13:17:09'),
