(251, 'https://gravity.attoexasolutions.com/post_images/1774455694_69c40b8e9e88c.jpeg', '🍽 Food Analysis Result\n\nCalories: 450 kcal\nProtein: 15 g\nCarbs: 60 g\nFat: 15 g\nFiber: 6 g\nSodium: 800 mg\nHealth Score: 75/100\n\n💬 What part of this meal felt most intentional for you? This platter offers a nice balance of vegetables and protein sources, and the presence of fiber-rich fillings and fresh garnish supports good nutrition.', NULL, 'published', 0, 0, 0, 0, 265, 2, '2026-03-25 10:21:46', '2026-03-25 10:21:46');
